<title>CANADA: Canada April natural gas production rises 4.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada April natural gas production rises 4.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada on Thursday issued the following data for crude oil and natural gas production and exports: CRUDE OIL AND EQUIVALENT HYDROCARBONS (thousand cubic meters)</p>
<p>		    Apr 1997     Apr 1996	 pct</p>
<p>   Production   9,035.8	9,083.7	 -0.5</p>
<p>   Exports	5,117.8	4,977.8	 +2.8</p>
<p>   Imports	3,336.0	2,795.5	+19.3</p>
<p>   Ref receipts 7,104.0	6,710.7	 +5.9</p>
<p>NATURAL GAS (millions of cubic meters)</p>
<p>		   Apr 1997     Apr 1996	  pct</p>
<p>   Production  13,046.6     12,444.3	 +4.8</p>
<p>   Exports	6,714.6	6,422.0	 +4.6</p>
<p>   Canada sales 6,096.3	5,665.1	 +7.6</p>
<p>CRUDE OIL</p>
<p>(thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>		   Jan-Apr 1997  Jan-Apr 1996   pct</p>
<p>   Production     38,445.6   38,004.9	+1.2</p>
<p>   Exports	  21,595.0   20,709.1	+4.3</p>
<p>   Imports	  14,258.7   13,283.3	+7.3</p>
<p>   Ref receipts   31,146.8   30,565.1	+1.9</p>
<p>NATURAL GAS</p>
<p>(milions of Cubic meters)</p>
<p>   Production     53,319.8   51,671.1	+3.2</p>
<p>   Exports	  27,784.3   26,742.6	+3.9</p>
<p>   Canada sales   29,293.9   28,952.2	+1.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Canada sales include direct sales.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gerard O'Connor, Energy Section, (613) 951-3562.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
</text>
